"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aa133c29/uploads/origins/487dbbf2-1823-4434-a680-758929a6d044?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e22ed1b7463e116dbd46f818f1b11f8e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aa133c29/uploads/origins/487dbbf2-1823-4434-a680-758929a6d044?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e22ed1b7463e116dbd46f818f1b11f8e, https://si.imgix.net/aa133c29/uploads/origins/487dbbf2-1823-4434-a680-758929a6d044?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b73ed7212efe8b9142a1147bd576366a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aa133c29/uploads/origins/487dbbf2-1823-4434-a680-758929a6d044?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aec09b2485dedf0155faba7a294b4ee0 3x"}, "body": "Dear Jaw Pasta, it's nice to meet you!\nI love your parent/child stories and always look forward to them...!\n\nI love the muscular men you draw, so I sent a request for you to draw a joint creation of a man and a woman ✨.\n\nI would like it to be in color, but since it's two characters, I'm fine with whichever one you prefer!\nThe composition should be cool and I would like to leave it to you...!\nYou are more than welcome to use it for advertising purposes!\n\nBelow are the materials and a light explanation of the relationship between the two characters.\n＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿\nThe Otherworldly Task Force.\nA department where people with otherworldly abilities are gathered.\nIts main task is to defeat skeinity (otherworldly creatures) that appear from the gates that connect to the other world, and to close the gates of the other world.\nThere are a wide variety of forms and shapes of skeiniti, and there is no fixed form.\n\nRaiden\nAbility: Electricity\nWeapon: Handgun (Beretta)\nPersonality: Dull and cynical. He is a hard worker who often gets into trouble with Tran. He is also a bit unpopular.\n\nTran\nAbility: Instantaneous movement\nWeapons: Handgun and survival knife\nPersonality: cheerful and approachable. She is a little crass, but a cool older sister.\n\nRelationships\nWork colleague (old-timer in the different world task force).\nWe are close in age and have similar interests, so we sometimes go touring together.\nThey also often drink together because Tran likes to drink, but Raiden is reluctant to drink because he is caught by Tran.\nTran seems to be one-sidedly involved, but they trust each other and think they can trust this guy to have their backs.\n＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿\n\nI hope you find it interesting and I look forward to working with you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SmtaHwI-ic7ctUMEO_CT-E97Cr8jQkYS", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 393571, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "えびみりん", "screen_name": "ebimirin1214", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1818113576852398080/fI7vr8lB.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/811625883010113536/1722771473/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "video"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 0}, {"id": 2332051, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "名無", "screen_name": "zyuua_", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F76548111-3697-49a4-a33c-61faeaed2f2f.png&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/9f5fef9a-f9a2-42d7-ba95-9b3fd50a9ef5.webp", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "a